{"about_the_game":"&quot;Deep in the woods&quot; offers a unique touch-based puzzle experience, resembling a beautiful painting. Players can explore meticulously designed scenes by dragging and sliding on the screen, enhancing visual aesthetics and immersion, making the interactive puzzle elements more enjoyable.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Beautiful scene</h2>The game follows a classical quest for family, unfolding throughout the changing seasons with exquisite scenes for players to discover clues and advance the story.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294110/extras/b67aacd73886edc107bfc9b59ca45720.avif?t=1740645541\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Distinct seasons </h2>Throughout the game, distinct characters, beasts, monsters, and spirits contribute to the mysterious, beautiful, and dangerous atmosphere of the deep forest. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294110/extras/b9b68d23d52cd30fb0f679ef4b726d10.avif?t=1740645541\" width=600 height=338 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enriching puzzles</h2>Filled with various engaging mini-games, the puzzles in the game challenge players' observational skills, so be cautious not to get lost in the enchanting scenes!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294110/extras/27115ed0774adb1118c0c96906832a30.avif?t=1740645541\" width=600 height=338 /></span><br><strong>Are you ready to enter this deep forest?</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1294110/extras/175a93011406fa7063a49eab76ccc47c.avif?t=1740645541\" width=600 height=338 /></span>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1294110?t=1740645541","backgroun